## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: state object `S`, `rnd(S)` mulberry32 used via `rint/rpick` everywhere; `resolveTurn()` fixed 9-step order. Score 2.

**F2 Map**: `GRID=8`, `genTerrain(S)` seeded via `rnd`; `placeError()` checks `b.terr.includes(S.tiles[i])`; `adj`/`adjMul` read in `outMul()`/`adjFlat()` change output. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: chains ash→soil (composter), soil+water→food (greenhouse), ore→metal (forge); caps via `capOf`, overflow step 3 destroys excess + logs. Score 2.

**F4 Population**: colonist record has `skill,fatigue,morale,job,at`; `effOf()` reads skill/fatigue in production formula. Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: `consumption()` per-turn food/water; shortfall step 4 lowers morale step 5 via `supply` ratio; fed colonists recover (+3), not instant death. Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 12 nodes in `TECH`; `buyTech()` enforces `pre.every(has)`, deducts cost; effects (`prodMul`,`capMul`,`storm`,`unlock`) read in `outMul`,`capMul`,`stormMitigation`. Score 2.

**F7 Events**: 14 entries in `EVENTS`; `fireEvent()` weighted cumulative pick; 6 events (vein, strangers, blight, cache, sickness, raiders) have 2-3 differing choices; `S.evCooldown[pick.id]=pick.cd` decremented each turn. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: `priceInfo()` reads `S.res[k]` fill and `S.market[k]` drift; `S.caravan.inv` finite, decremented on buy; `tradeBuy`/`tradeSell` both implemented and wired to UI buttons. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard**: storm fires at `S.turn>=S.storm.next`; `stormSeverity` grows with turn/count; `integrityFactor` zeroes output below 0.35; `windbreaks`/`stormglass` tech and `windbreak` building cut damage; `doRepair` costs parts. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load**: `saveText()`→textarea copy; `loadText()` validates ver/fields/terrain/colonists/buildings, throws `Error`, caught and shown in `#saveinfo`. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions**: win at turn 60 with pop≥12 & needsMet; loss on pop≤0 or failed bar; `scoreOf()` combines pop/skill/tech/stock/turns/storms/losses; `showEnd()` renders summary modal. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: `renderTabs()` + click/keydown handlers switch tabs; log entries show `T`+turn; extensive `data-tip` breakdowns; space/1-6/Escape shortcuts; `@media(min-width:760px)` two-column layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel**: `runTests()` 30 assertions on real invariants (caps, prereqs, morale/fatigue effect on output, storm mitigation monotonicity, save round-trip); `runBenchmark()` runs `greedyTurn+resolveTurn(headless)` 200 turns, `stateHash()` printed. Score 2.

**G1**: `TECH.hydrology.eff.prodMul.condenser` read in `outMul()`, consumed by `projectBuilding()`; test13 confirms +25%. Score 4.

**G2**: `consumption()`→step4 shortfall→step5 `d -= p` morale penalty→`effOf().mor` scales labour, consumed in `projectBuilding`; test19 confirms. Score 4.

**G3**: storm loop damages `bd.integrity`; `integrityFactor` zeroes/reduces `projectBuilding` output; `doRepair` spends `parts`, restores integrity to 1; test21/22 confirm. Score 4.

**G4**: `priceInfo()` uses `S.res[k]/capOf` (`stockMod`) and `S.market[k]` (drifted each turn in step 6); test24 confirms falling sell price with fuller stock. Score 4.

**G5**: `vein`/`strangers`/`cache`/`raiders` choices each write distinct `S.res`, `S.people`, or `S.b[i].integrity` changes; test26 confirms every event alters `stateHash`. Score 4.

